# Trial by Fire (battlefield.trial_by_fire, CloisterOfFlames, a BattlefieldQuest of Outlands.TrialByFire, a C# quest; index 0, 30
# minutes, 6 players, the Tuning Fork of Fire required, Fire_Protocrystal the exit). A level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the fork. The trigger: the menu 32000. Updates: 0 (index 0, area 0) and 4 (past the zone's arenas): REQS_NOT_MET; 1
# (area 1): registered, entered (the fork taken). The boss of arena 1 killed: its group's allDeath sets WON; the win
# (BattlefieldQuest's onBattlefieldWin, accepted): battlefieldWin set, 32001; its finish: the battlefield's
# onEventFinishWin, then the quest's 32001 handler. After the cleanup, out.
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventUpdate/32000 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32000 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByFire accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfFire
login
trigger FP_Entrance                     # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=0                   # 0: ignored
update 32000 option=4                   # area 4: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-21                  # the boss of arena 1: WON; 32001
finish                                  # the battlefield's finish, then the quest's handler
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
